"text":"最凶(最強)最悪の力の持ち主。能力名の通り性器を二つ有している。二つというのは、女性器と男性器の事。要はふたなりである。彼女は自身のクリトリスを肥大化させて男性器へと変える力を持っている。しかしそれだけではなく、彼女の体内で作られる精液は特別製であり、浴びたり体内に入ってしまったら男も女も問わずに彼女の肉棒と精液の虜となり堕ちてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","sourceWorkId":"17322","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初対面の人、とりわけ男性にも友好的に接するという珍しい部類である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそれは彼女の一面… 猫を被っている部分の話……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「男も女も私のチ○ポミルクでヒィヒィ言ってればいいのよッ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40884"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"b","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33740","value":"b"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5722","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40884","value":"女"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afe327c174223b5cd14330fc7125d358b9708f9f21196388022c7beb0e76a659.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c361c1621c78d61d1d1f8a68629ae3964e81f6cfb80323aff51a44b0e597490.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さとうもも","creatorId":"vndb:s5155","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5155","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5155","name":"さとう