ば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にゴスロリ服を着用しているのは、彼女達の趣味だそうだ。制服は捨てたらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゴスロリ服の下には様々な武器が隠されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異能力：「吸引する膣穴(チューチュー☆ペット)」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の力は膣を自分の意志で自由に動かす事が出来る能力。うねらせ、捻り、吸い上げ…など、多彩な技を使って男をイかせる事に特化している。体のサイズも相まって童貞など挿入から三秒で射精してしまうらしい。見た目の可愛さに侮ると、痛い目を見る事になるだろう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5723","sourceWorkId":"17322","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の2年生で双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉ととても仲良しでいつも一緒にいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり自己主張をせず、ボーっとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……ばーか」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40882"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"66 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5723","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"149 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5723","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"64 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5723","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"50 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5723","sourceWorkId":"17322","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/0047a5bfffaaa77d6541ee5b01517089ff3bfc2cca86ae85d9a8c7fc1c291b8c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/8237f7c24958d7aa7f6f4598a4cc4857a57fee3d11b902e194565e9502370573.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"相元ゆうき","creatorId":"vndb:s3571","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3571","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3571","name":"相元 ゆうき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:44101:40882:58558:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33743